# The deployable website is self-contained in apps/web.
# Keep native apps, protocol fixtures, design sources, and evidence out of uploads.
/*
# Vercel's directory walker checks paths without a trailing slash.
!/apps
/apps/*
!/apps/web
!/LICENSE
!/NOTICE
!/vercel.json
!/.vercelignore

# Generated output, dependencies, and local-only files.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/coverage
**/.git
**/.vercel
**/.superdev
**/.env*
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Agent instructions and scaffold documentation are not website inputs.
/apps/web/AGENTS.md
/apps/web/README.md
